            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective January 1, 2002, each employee covered under this Agreement shall receive an increase in 2001 salary and hourly rate of four percent (4%). Such increase shall be added to the 2001 salary and hourly rate of each employee as well as to the 2001 salary and hourly rate schedules. Each employee due an increment shall receive such increment in accordance with the appropriate contractual provisions.",
