        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Any employee involved in any action/incident which may be the subject of litigation must cooperate with the County Attorney's office in all respects. Such employee must respond promptly to letters, must appear for interviews, hearings, and examinations as requested by the County Attorney's office or its retained counsel.",
