            "block_content": "In accordance with this agreement, all employees covered by this bargaining unit are now subject only to reasonable suspicion testing for drugs and alcohol. The drugs that will be subject to this testing are Marijuana, Cocaine, Amphetamines, Opiates (including heroin) and Phencyclidine (PCP).",
